    "id": "k8s-hpa",
    "title": "Kubernetes : HorizontalPodAutoscaler",
    "description": "Auto-scaling sur CPU.",
    "level": "avance",
    "order": 214,
    "entryFile": "/hpa.yaml",
    "initialFiles": {
      "/hpa.yaml": "apiVersion: autoscaling/v2\nkind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler\nmetadata:\n  name: app-hpa\nspec:\n  scaleTargetRef:\n    apiVersion: apps/v1\n    kind: Deployment\n    name: app\n  minReplicas: 1\n  maxReplicas: 5\n  metrics:\n    - type: Resource\n      resource:\n        name: cpu\n        target:\n          type: Utilization\n          averageUtilization: 70\n"
    },
    "instructions": "## Objectif\nChangez **minReplicas** à **2** dans `hpa.yaml`.",
